  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Kigali Implementation Plan to phase down HFC in Benin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is to prepare and implement the Kigali Implementation Plan (KIP) for HFCs phase down in Benin in compliance with the Kigali Amendment. The project preparation activities include gathering and analyzing updated data, stakeholder consultation, legislative review, strategy development, and technical assistance for the finalization of the overarching strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
